# Environment and deployment secrets. The root .env is platform-managed, holds only
# public (publishable) connection values and MUST stay in Git: the published site is
# built from Git, and without it the browser has no database connection (blank screen).
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
!/.env
.dev.vars*
.npmrc

